917
00:45:13.078 --> 00:45:15.646
[error tones beeping]

918
00:45:19.317 --> 00:45:21.251
[sniffing]

919
00:45:21.252 --> 00:45:23.587
[coughing]

920
00:45:23.588 --> 00:45:26.524
