930
00:47:39.224 --> 00:47:41.026
No, thank you, sir.

931
00:47:44.362 --> 00:47:45.262
No luck, huh?

932
00:47:45.263 --> 00:47:47.597
Not today.

933
00:47:47.598 --> 00:47:49.066
