934
00:47:49.067 --> 00:47:50.100
Yeah.

935
00:47:50.101 --> 00:47:51.135
[chuckling]

936
00:47:51.136 --> 00:47:54.071
Maybe it's the smoke.

937
00:47:54.072 --> 00:47:55.605
