979
00:50:28.693 --> 00:50:29.853
[faint replies] Good morning.

980
00:50:31.429 --> 00:50:34.131
It's an honor
to be here with you.

981
00:50:34.132 --> 00:50:37.967
I'm proud.

982
00:50:37.968 --> 00:50:39.203
If you're like me,

983
00:50:39.204 --> 00:50:42.972
