1061
00:53:39.083 --> 00:53:43.253
[crowd chanting] White power!
White power!

1062
00:53:43.254 --> 00:53:46.222
[chanting] White power!
White power!

1063
00:53:46.223 --> 00:53:49.293
White power! White power!
White power! White power!

1064
00:53:49.294 --> 00:53:51.928
[chanting] White power!
White power! White power!

1065
