So, I've been thinking
about these guys.

1073
00:54:10.581 --> 00:54:12.982
You know, it's obviously
not just a cash grab.

1074
00:54:12.983 --> 00:54:14.984
There's a method
to what they're doing.

1075
00:54:14.985 --> 00:54:16.520
You know, it's like,

1076
